    {
      "id": "boss_ability:cove:p001",
      "bossId": "shambler",
      "name": "Shambler",
      "level": 1,
      "cardRole": "description",
      "actionsPerRound": null,
      "sourcePage": 1,
      "boss": true,
      "poolEligible": false,
      "combatReady": false,
      "front": {
        "sourceFile": "DARKEST_DUNGEON_PRINT_EN_WAVE 2/MG_DD_05_EN_COVE/DD_EN_COVE_CARDS_70_120_Boss_Abilities_FRONT.pdf",
        "textLines": [
          "In the damp recesses of the cove, a",
          "tempting glint amid the gloom. The",
          "gem nestled in the tight grip of this",
          "altar’s sconce promises riches beyond",
          "worldly compare. Yet the closer you",
          "draw, the more you feel your temples",
          "pulse. A blinding aura shimmers",
          "near every source of light. The altar",
          "beckons - a lucky find or a priceless",
          "lure, the thread of which reaches into",
          "the malefic dark between the stars.",
          "What angler will sense your pull?"
        ]
      },
      "back": {
        "sourceFile": "DARKEST_DUNGEON_PRINT_EN_WAVE 2/MG_DD_05_EN_COVE/DD_EN_COVE_CARDS_70_120_Boss_Abilities_BACK.pdf",
        "textLines": ["{icon:56ea9289ab} I"]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "boss_ability:cove:p002",
      "bossId": "shambler",
      "name": "Shambler",
      "level": 2,
      "cardRole": "description",
      "actionsPerRound": null,
      "sourcePage": 2,
      "boss": true,
      "poolEligible": false,
      "combatReady": false,
      "front": {
        "sourceFile": "DARKEST_DUNGEON_PRINT_EN_WAVE 2/MG_DD_05_EN_COVE/DD_EN_COVE_CARDS_70_120_Boss_Abilities_FRONT.pdf",
        "textLines": [
          "Writhing tendrils, skin that shines with",
          "the light of black stars rising over",
          "worlds beyond our ken - through",
          "happenstance or confidence, you",
          "have triggered the trap. The few who",
          "have crossed its path have nothing to",
          "offer, none can even say whether the",
          "shambler hunts with preternatural",
          "guile or whether some unknown sect",
          "has lured it here themselves. Theory",
          "matters not in the heat of battle. Act",
          "quickly, slay the thing before it drowns",
          "you in the dark void which birthed it!"
        ]
      },
      "back": {
        "sourceFile": "DARKEST_DUNGEON_PRINT_EN_WAVE 2/MG_DD_05_EN_COVE/DD_EN_COVE_CARDS_70_120_Boss_Abilities_BACK.pdf",
        "textLines": ["{icon:56ea9289ab} II"]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "boss_ability:cove:p003",
      "bossId": "shambler",
      "name": "Shambler",
      "level": 3,
      "cardRole": "description",
      "actionsPerRound": null,
      "sourcePage": 3,
      "boss": true,
      "poolEligible": false,
      "combatReady": false,
      "front": {
        "sourceFile": "DARKEST_DUNGEON_PRINT_EN_WAVE 2/MG_DD_05_EN_COVE/DD_EN_COVE_CARDS_70_120_Boss_Abilities_FRONT.pdf",
        "textLines": [
          "The chasms between the stars are",
          "bottomless, and contained within them",
          "is a callous cruelty humankind can",
          "only guess at. Can a being beyond our",
          "comprehension be said to hate? Is",
          "it even aware of the mortal laments",
          "caused by its rampant hunger? We",
          "will never know the shambler’s",
          "motivations, but we know it must be",
          "stopped! You, confident fool who has",
          "drawn it here, must banish this beast",
          "to the alien couloir whence it crawled!"
        ]
      },
      "back": {
        "sourceFile": "DARKEST_DUNGEON_PRINT_EN_WAVE 2/MG_DD_05_EN_COVE/DD_EN_COVE_CARDS_70_120_Boss_Abilities_BACK.pdf",
        "textLines": ["{icon:56ea9289ab} III"]
      }
    },
