    {
      "id": "boss_ability:cove:p007",
      "bossId": "siren",
      "name": "Siren",
      "level": 1,
      "cardRole": "description",
      "actionsPerRound": null,
      "sourcePage": 7,
      "boss": true,
      "poolEligible": false,
      "combatReady": false,
      "front": {
        "sourceFile": "DARKEST_DUNGEON_PRINT_EN_WAVE 2/MG_DD_05_EN_COVE/DD_EN_COVE_CARDS_70_120_Boss_Abilities_FRONT.pdf",
        "textLines": [
          "My lofty position wasn’t always",
          "accompanied by the fear of office,",
          "and there was a time I could walk the",
          "streets or raise a glass in the tavern",
          "without concern for molestation.",
          "Faithful as the tide, one precocious",
          "village waif made it her hobby to",
          "shadow my every errand. It was",
          "charming then, troublesome later."
        ]
      },
      "back": {
        "sourceFile": "DARKEST_DUNGEON_PRINT_EN_WAVE 2/MG_DD_05_EN_COVE/DD_EN_COVE_CARDS_70_120_Boss_Abilities_BACK.pdf",
        "textLines": ["{icon:56ea9289ab} I"]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "boss_ability:cove:p008",
      "bossId": "siren",
      "name": "Siren",
      "level": 2,
      "cardRole": "description",
      "actionsPerRound": null,
      "sourcePage": 8,
      "boss": true,
      "poolEligible": false,
      "combatReady": false,
      "front": {
        "sourceFile": "DARKEST_DUNGEON_PRINT_EN_WAVE 2/MG_DD_05_EN_COVE/DD_EN_COVE_CARDS_70_120_Boss_Abilities_FRONT.pdf",
        "textLines": [
          "In financial desperation, I struck",
          "a bargain with the ancient things",
          "that surfaced in search of sacrifice",
          "when the moon was right. Their",
          "price was the delivery of an obscure",
          "idol and one other item of more",
          "troubling portent. The pact struck,",
          "my newfound accomplices slipped",
          "silently beneath the brackish water.",
          "A fearful stirring at the edge of the",
          "torchlight betrayed a familiar witness,",
          "and gifted me with malign inspiration."
        ]
      },
      "back": {
        "sourceFile": "DARKEST_DUNGEON_PRINT_EN_WAVE 2/MG_DD_05_EN_COVE/DD_EN_COVE_CARDS_70_120_Boss_Abilities_BACK.pdf",
        "textLines": ["{icon:56ea9289ab} II"]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "boss_ability:cove:p009",
      "bossId": "siren",
      "name": "Siren",
      "level": 3,
      "cardRole": "description",
      "actionsPerRound": null,
      "sourcePage": 9,
      "boss": true,
      "poolEligible": false,
      "combatReady": false,
      "front": {
        "sourceFile": "DARKEST_DUNGEON_PRINT_EN_WAVE 2/MG_DD_05_EN_COVE/DD_EN_COVE_CARDS_70_120_Boss_Abilities_FRONT.pdf",
        "textLines": [
          "Under the blood moon, I lured my",
          "wide-eyed prey to the pier’s edge.",
          "Before she could properly appreciate",
          "her position, I clamped on a manacle,",
          "chaining her to the leering idol. A",
          "small push was sufficient to send",
          "both into the icy waters. And when",
          "at length the tide receded, jewels",
          "of the most magnificent grandeur",
          "lay scattered upon the shore."
        ]
      },
      "back": {
        "sourceFile": "DARKEST_DUNGEON_PRINT_EN_WAVE 2/MG_DD_05_EN_COVE/DD_EN_COVE_CARDS_70_120_Boss_Abilities_BACK.pdf",
        "textLines": ["{icon:56ea9289ab} III"]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "boss_ability:cove:p010",
      "bossId": "siren",
      "name": "Siren",
      "level": 1,
      "cardRole": "combat",
      "actionsPerRound": 2,
      "sourcePage": 10,
      "boss": true,
      "poolEligible": false,
      "combatReady": false,
      "front": {
        "sourceFile": "DARKEST_DUNGEON_PRINT_EN_WAVE 2/MG_DD_05_EN_COVE/DD_EN_COVE_CARDS_70_120_Boss_Abilities_FRONT.pdf",
        "textLines": [
          "Song of Desire: Before its first",
          "action each round, Siren forces",
          "all Heroes to move 1 towards {icon:5ff4d1af7c}",
          "Area (following Stance order).",
          "Summon {icon:ab045955ed} : When using",
          "Pressure Crash, Siren {icon:ab045955ed} a Sea",
          "Maggot. When using Devour,",
          "she {icon:ab045955ed} a Pelagic Grouper."
        ]
      },
      "back": {
        "sourceFile": "DARKEST_DUNGEON_PRINT_EN_WAVE 2/MG_DD_05_EN_COVE/DD_EN_COVE_CARDS_70_120_Boss_Abilities_BACK.pdf",
        "textLines": [
          "Songs in the Dark I",
          "When scouting, drop the {icon:c5731a729f} by 1.",
          "Luring Tunes I",
          "On the first preparation day,",
          "one randomly chosen Hero",
          "must roll to see which building",
          "they visit. If the building is",
          "blocked they will not visit",
          "any building, though they can",
          "still use their Hamlet Skill."
        ]
      }
    },
