    {
      "id": "boss_ability:cove:p013",
      "bossId": "drowned_crew",
      "name": "Drowned Crew",
      "level": 1,
      "cardRole": "description",
      "actionsPerRound": null,
      "sourcePage": 13,
      "boss": true,
      "poolEligible": false,
      "combatReady": false,
      "front": {
        "sourceFile": "DARKEST_DUNGEON_PRINT_EN_WAVE 2/MG_DD_05_EN_COVE/DD_EN_COVE_CARDS_70_120_Boss_Abilities_FRONT.pdf",
        "textLines": [
          "Prying eyes had become a nuisance",
          "along the Old Road, and so I undertook",
          "to receive my most curious deliveries",
          "by way of marine shipments. A",
          "sheltered jetty was accessible by a",
          "narrow stone stair off the back of",
          "the manor, and a discreet system",
          "of pulleys could hoist even the",
          "heaviest prizes up the rock face",
          "from a securely tied dinghy below."
        ]
      },
      "back": {
        "sourceFile": "DARKEST_DUNGEON_PRINT_EN_WAVE 2/MG_DD_05_EN_COVE/DD_EN_COVE_CARDS_70_120_Boss_Abilities_BACK.pdf",
        "textLines": ["{icon:56ea9289ab} I"]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "boss_ability:cove:p014",
      "bossId": "drowned_crew",
      "name": "Drowned Crew",
      "level": 2,
      "cardRole": "description",
      "actionsPerRound": null,
      "sourcePage": 14,
      "boss": true,
      "poolEligible": false,
      "combatReady": false,
      "front": {
        "sourceFile": "DARKEST_DUNGEON_PRINT_EN_WAVE 2/MG_DD_05_EN_COVE/DD_EN_COVE_CARDS_70_120_Boss_Abilities_FRONT.pdf",
        "textLines": [
          "I employed a crew of particularly",
          "unsavory mariners, who, for a time,",
          "sailed the four corners at my behest",
          "- retrieving many valuable artifacts,",
          "relics and rare texts. Predictably,",
          "they increased their tariffs to",
          "counter my intense stipulations of",
          "secrecy. Such resources had long",
          "been exhausted, of course, and so I",
          "prepared an... alternative payment."
        ]
      },
      "back": {
        "sourceFile": "DARKEST_DUNGEON_PRINT_EN_WAVE 2/MG_DD_05_EN_COVE/DD_EN_COVE_CARDS_70_120_Boss_Abilities_BACK.pdf",
        "textLines": ["{icon:56ea9289ab} II"]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "boss_ability:cove:p015",
      "bossId": "drowned_crew",
      "name": "Drowned Crew",
      "level": 3,
      "cardRole": "description",
      "actionsPerRound": null,
      "sourcePage": 15,
      "boss": true,
      "poolEligible": false,
      "combatReady": false,
      "front": {
        "sourceFile": "DARKEST_DUNGEON_PRINT_EN_WAVE 2/MG_DD_05_EN_COVE/DD_EN_COVE_CARDS_70_120_Boss_Abilities_FRONT.pdf",
        "textLines": [
          "While the greedy dogs slept off their",
          "revelry, I hexed their anchor with",
          "every twisted incantation I could",
          "muster - imbuing it with the weight",
          "of my ambition, and my contempt",
          "for their crude extortion. At the",
          "witching hour, the anchor pulled with",
          "preternatural force, dragging craft",
          "and crew down into the depths. They",
          "must have cried out, but no sound",
          "escaped the swirling black waters..."
        ]
      },
      "back": {
        "sourceFile": "DARKEST_DUNGEON_PRINT_EN_WAVE 2/MG_DD_05_EN_COVE/DD_EN_COVE_CARDS_70_120_Boss_Abilities_BACK.pdf",
        "textLines": ["{icon:56ea9289ab} III"]
      }
    },
    {
